mmary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsSaved</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsSaved\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsSaved\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fe8c0c14-7484-4562-94b9-e99b0301867e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fe8c0c14-7484-4562-94b9-e99b0301867e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fe8c0c14-7484-4562-94b9-e99b0301867e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ca47f2391d39c6b3END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e894bb3c71b66e9aEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsFailed</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsFailed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsFailed\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7e91fa6a-dee7-4ed2-876f-a0081b8e5c33</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7e91fa6a-dee7-4ed2-876f-a0081b8e5c33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7e91fa6a-dee7-4ed2-876f-a0081b8e5c33\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a>, in the personal bedroom, inside the cabinet beside the bed at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-15&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-93</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<dl><dd><i>If <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan's</a> siblings <a href=\"/wiki/Cal\" title=\"Cal\">Cal</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lia\" title=\"Lia\">Lia</a> survived</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsSaved</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsSaved\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsSaved\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fe8c0c14-7484-4562-94b9-e99b0301867e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fe8c0c14-7484-4562-94b9-e99b0301867e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fe8c0c14-7484-4562-94b9-e99b0301867e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p><br>\nAll has happened according to my plan. The way was rough - too rough - but we've arrived exactly where we're meant to be - where I am meant to be. Master <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a> is a braggart and a hypocrite, but he has what I need: resources. Knowledge. The ability to become who I truly am. Cal and Lia roll their eyes, but they least of anyone can deny my potential. They know what I could become  - if only I endure a little longer.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Rolan's siblings Cal and Lia did not survive</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsFailed</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsFailed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_RolanJournalSiblingsFailed\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7e91fa6a-dee7-4ed2-876f-a0081b8e5c33</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7e91fa6a-dee7-4ed2-876f-a0081b8e5c33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7e91fa6a-dee7-4ed2-876f-a0081b8e5c33\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p><br>\n...I can endure it. I don't care. Let Lorroakan bluster and boast. Even a braggart has his uses. If I were to leave, it will have been for nothing - the loss, the death. The grief. Impossible. That sort of loss doesn't happen without some purpose. I am that purpose. Is that hubris? Of course. But I've nothing left if not my belief in myself - in what I can learn, what I can do. Some day. Soon.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715021520\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2432/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61970/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21018/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1186898/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time